  "description": "The two STAC GeoParquet index files of the NAIP visualization COGs: one item per hosted RGB JPEG Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFF quarter quad, and one per overview file. Each item gives the file's address, size, SHA-256, footprint, CRS and flight date, and the address relative to stac/ that stac/naip.gti uses to open the index in GDAL or QGIS as one mosaic. The imagery is not in this package; the indexes point to it at data.source.coop/nthh/naip/.",
